    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>--You MUST protect the Castle--</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The goblins are coming! </strong><i>Oh my, there are so many.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/0c30d3a7fc70b4fe7fba8eecc5a33265.poster.avif?t=1751524134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/0c30d3a7fc70b4fe7fba8eecc5a33265.webm?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/0c30d3a7fc70b4fe7fba8eecc5a33265.mp4?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Goblin Storm is a <strong>roguelike survival experience</strong> where the player must defend their castle at all costs. As the game progresses, the attacking goblin forces will grow stronger and stronger. <br><br>Do you have what it takes to protect the realm?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>---Game Features---</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weaponry:</strong><br>Over 50 unique and exciting weapons to arm yourself with! Everything from simple bows, maces, katanas, land mines, and even flamethrowers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match your armory of weapons to come up with satisfying combos, find counters to certain enemies, and maximize the strengths of your characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/ccda305c6f01701a05e445778bb2c108.avif?t=1751524134\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Player Classes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features three unique classes. The Knight, the Ranger, and the Mercenary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each has their own gameplay focus and a variety of different playstyles you can choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/af6ff109c9235302b6a271c45369311b.poster.avif?t=1751524134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/af6ff109c9235302b6a271c45369311b.webm?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/af6ff109c9235302b6a271c45369311b.mp4?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ranger</strong> is a swift footed archer, focusing on boosting a variety of ranged weaponry, setting traps, poisoning and slowing enemies, and unleashing devasting volleys from afar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/8640a8686810c65c61780399079e8907.poster.avif?t=1751524134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/8640a8686810c65c61780399079e8907.webm?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/8640a8686810c65c61780399079e8907.mp4?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Knight</strong> is a sturdy bastion, destined for the front lines of war. They excel at close quarters combat, shrugging off enemy blows and even healing themselves. Oh, they can ride a noble steed too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/8f6ee87995226010d0f8b5d9895384e7.poster.avif?t=1751524134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/8f6ee87995226010d0f8b5d9895384e7.webm?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/8f6ee87995226010d0f8b5d9895384e7.mp4?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mercenary </strong>is the jack of all trades. They can seamlessly weave between ranged and melee, turning invisible, and even dual wielding. They can get extra gold and easier access to rarer weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/39c5c0eb54828839b70f706f0c80bc04.avif?t=1751524134\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Castle </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's your base of operations. Spend gold and upgrade it according to your desires. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create spiked pits, boiling oil cauldrons, arrow turrets, mountable ballistae and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build huge towers to give yourself better vantage points, or focus on passive upgrades, such as extra gold or HP every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/ce4886e351c68e91c5f4eb1c16e1c79c.avif?t=1751524134\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mining</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth extra treasure and gold from mining. However, be wary, for all this extra wealth will surely just attract more Greedy Goblins!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Goblins!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features over 50 different goblins. Goblin brutes, self-detonating goblins, ninja goblins, flying goblins, pirate goblins, spider-riding goblins, goblinapults and many more! <br><br>Learn their patterns well and you may be able to survive another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/61741057bf8ffd0b27fbb574ada93abc.poster.avif?t=1751524134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/61741057bf8ffd0b27fbb574ada93abc.webm?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/61741057bf8ffd0b27fbb574ada93abc.mp4?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Bosses!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They mean business. Every ten waves, a powerful Boss goblin will arrive on your border. They all have unique, interesting mechanics, such as eating their underlings, or launching cannon barrages. Your resolve will be tested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/4b98e80f9506d329c51346a4e97b2dc8.avif?t=1751524134\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP</strong> is currently enabled locally, and the game has controller support. Call over some friends and save the realm together. Design synergistic party compositions to get the job done. Online multiplayer is currently under development too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblin\u00a0Storm is a <strong>roguelike</strong>, featuring randomized waves and weaponry options. Try a variety of different builds, classes and weapons\u00a0to see which playstyle you like most. The game is designed for <strong>re-playability</strong>\u00a0and will eventually feature a meta currency that is saved between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/31dea37ac6fa7ff5b7d5d6c4d194fd7a.poster.avif?t=1751524134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/31dea37ac6fa7ff5b7d5d6c4d194fd7a.webm?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/31dea37ac6fa7ff5b7d5d6c4d194fd7a.mp4?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, what are you waiting for? </strong>THE GOBLINS ARE COMING! Get onto the battlefield and save your lands from falling to <strong>The Goblin Storm!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WISHLIST NOW!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>--You MUST protect the Castle--</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The goblins are coming! </strong><i>Oh my, there are so many.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/0c30d3a7fc70b4fe7fba8eecc5a33265.poster.avif?t=1751524134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/0c30d3a7fc70b4fe7fba8eecc5a33265.webm?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/0c30d3a7fc70b4fe7fba8eecc5a33265.mp4?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Goblin Storm is a <strong>roguelike survival experience</strong> where the player must defend their castle at all costs. As the game progresses, the attacking goblin forces will grow stronger and stronger. <br><br>Do you have what it takes to protect the realm?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>---Game Features---</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weaponry:</strong><br>Over 50 unique and exciting weapons to arm yourself with! Everything from simple bows, maces, katanas, land mines, and even flamethrowers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match your armory of weapons to come up with satisfying combos, find counters to certain enemies, and maximize the strengths of your characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/ccda305c6f01701a05e445778bb2c108.avif?t=1751524134\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Player Classes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features three unique classes. The Knight, the Ranger, and the Mercenary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each has their own gameplay focus and a variety of different playstyles you can choose from.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/af6ff109c9235302b6a271c45369311b.poster.avif?t=1751524134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/af6ff109c9235302b6a271c45369311b.webm?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/af6ff109c9235302b6a271c45369311b.mp4?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Ranger</strong> is a swift footed archer, focusing on boosting a variety of ranged weaponry, setting traps, poisoning and slowing enemies, and unleashing devasting volleys from afar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/8640a8686810c65c61780399079e8907.poster.avif?t=1751524134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/8640a8686810c65c61780399079e8907.webm?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/8640a8686810c65c61780399079e8907.mp4?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Knight</strong> is a sturdy bastion, destined for the front lines of war. They excel at close quarters combat, shrugging off enemy blows and even healing themselves. Oh, they can ride a noble steed too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/8f6ee87995226010d0f8b5d9895384e7.poster.avif?t=1751524134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/8f6ee87995226010d0f8b5d9895384e7.webm?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/8f6ee87995226010d0f8b5d9895384e7.mp4?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Mercenary </strong>is the jack of all trades. They can seamlessly weave between ranged and melee, turning invisible, and even dual wielding. They can get extra gold and easier access to rarer weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/39c5c0eb54828839b70f706f0c80bc04.avif?t=1751524134\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Castle </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's your base of operations. Spend gold and upgrade it according to your desires. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create spiked pits, boiling oil cauldrons, arrow turrets, mountable ballistae and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Build huge towers to give yourself better vantage points, or focus on passive upgrades, such as extra gold or HP every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/ce4886e351c68e91c5f4eb1c16e1c79c.avif?t=1751524134\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mining</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth extra treasure and gold from mining. However, be wary, for all this extra wealth will surely just attract more Greedy Goblins!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Goblins!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features over 50 different goblins. Goblin brutes, self-detonating goblins, ninja goblins, flying goblins, pirate goblins, spider-riding goblins, goblinapults and many more! <br><br>Learn their patterns well and you may be able to survive another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/61741057bf8ffd0b27fbb574ada93abc.poster.avif?t=1751524134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/61741057bf8ffd0b27fbb574ada93abc.webm?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/61741057bf8ffd0b27fbb574ada93abc.mp4?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Bosses!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They mean business. Every ten waves, a powerful Boss goblin will arrive on your border. They all have unique, interesting mechanics, such as eating their underlings, or launching cannon barrages. Your resolve will be tested.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/4b98e80f9506d329c51346a4e97b2dc8.avif?t=1751524134\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CO-OP</strong> is currently enabled locally, and the game has controller support. Call over some friends and save the realm together. Design synergistic party compositions to get the job done. Online multiplayer is currently under development too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblin\u00a0Storm is a <strong>roguelike</strong>, featuring randomized waves and weaponry options. Try a variety of different builds, classes and weapons\u00a0to see which playstyle you like most. The game is designed for <strong>re-playability</strong>\u00a0and will eventually feature a meta currency that is saved between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/31dea37ac6fa7ff5b7d5d6c4d194fd7a.poster.avif?t=1751524134\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/31dea37ac6fa7ff5b7d5d6c4d194fd7a.webm?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543260/extras/31dea37ac6fa7ff5b7d5d6c4d194fd7a.mp4?t=1751524134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, what are you waiting for? </strong>THE GOBLINS ARE COMING! Get onto the battlefield and save your lands from falling to <strong>The Goblin Storm!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WISHLIST NOW!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
